// Copy to Signing.xcconfig, set your own team, and include it from AppInfo.xcconfig.
// 1. Apple Developer → Membership → Team ID (10 chars).
// 2. DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <your Team ID>.
// 3. Replace YOURTEAMID in the entitlements and GroupChannel id.
// 4. Build: flutter build macos --dart-define=EDITION=lite.
